# === GIỮ LẠI cho chấm bài ===
# evidence/html-reports/**/index.html   ← 9 HTML reports
# evidence/html-reports/**/data/*.md    ← log text (không video)
# evidence/execution-summary.json
# automation/data/, tests/, helpers/

# Playwright đính kèm trong HTML report — quá nặng cho git (~227 webm)
